WEBVTT

00:11.033 --> 00:13.578
‎SPORTS FESTIVAL
‎MEITEN HIGH SCHOOL

00:13.661 --> 00:16.205
‎THE DAY OF THE SPORTS FESTIVAL
‎6:30 A.M.

00:16.289 --> 00:18.541
‎What's up, Tsukko?

00:18.624 --> 00:19.959
‎Oh, nothing, really...

00:20.543 --> 00:23.796
‎It's just I'm only on the cheer squad
‎because I went with the herd mentality.

00:23.880 --> 00:29.302
‎Now I'm feeling nervous,
‎and worrying about messing up my moves.

00:30.303 --> 00:33.181
‎I'm more of a culture kid than sports.

00:33.264 --> 00:38.227
‎I'm a little worried about whether people
‎would even want me rooting for them.

00:38.311 --> 00:40.438
‎Of course they want you rooting for them!

00:40.521 --> 00:42.065
‎So you better get out there and cheer.

00:42.148 --> 00:43.232
<i>‎I know how you feel.</i>

00:44.859 --> 00:47.987
‎Will you please root for Momoka?

00:48.946 --> 00:50.198
<i>‎She wants me to root for her.</i>

00:50.823 --> 00:53.284
<i>‎Well, it's not like Momoka's
‎a bad person or anything,</i>

00:53.785 --> 00:56.829
<i>‎and it's not like I want
‎anything more from Amamiya.</i>

00:57.330 --> 01:01.292
<i>‎In fact, Amamiya's nice to everyone.</i>

01:01.959 --> 01:04.504
<i>‎So of course it makes sense
‎that he's nice to me too.</i>

01:05.129 --> 01:09.425
<i>‎And it's not like anybody
‎really cares about my feelings.</i>

01:10.426 --> 01:11.636
<i>‎So there's no big deal...</i>

01:21.020 --> 01:22.438
<i>‎Don't overthink this.</i>

01:22.980 --> 01:24.148
<i>‎Don't overthink this.</i>

01:25.108 --> 01:26.234
<i>‎Act normal.</i>

01:26.943 --> 01:28.027
<i>‎Act normal.</i>

02:59.577 --> 03:03.998
‎EPISODE 13
‎PERCEPTION

03:04.081 --> 03:06.292
‎THE DAY OF THE SPORTS FESTIVAL 7:00 A.M.
‎FINAL MORNING PRACTICE

03:06.375 --> 03:08.753
‎-Let's win this thing!
‎-Yeah!

03:08.836 --> 03:10.338
‎8:00 A.M. - THE GIRLS DO THEIR HAIR

03:10.421 --> 03:14.258
‎I've got plenty of blue accessories here.
‎Come take whatever you want for your hair.

03:14.342 --> 03:16.260
‎THOSE WITH TIME TO SPARE
‎BECAUSE THEY HAVE SHORT HAIR

03:16.344 --> 03:18.846
‎-Yota. Can I go all out with your hair?
‎-All out?

03:18.930 --> 03:22.475
‎You sure this is okay?
‎It's not gonna look strange?

03:22.558 --> 03:23.976
‎It's fine!

03:28.105 --> 03:30.441
‎Everyone's hair looks amazing.

03:32.109 --> 03:33.694
‎And the girls too.

03:33.778 --> 03:35.613
‎20 MINS AGO - NICE SOFT HAIR
‎FRIENDLY STRANGER SENIORS

03:35.696 --> 03:36.697
‎Let me do your hair.

03:38.741 --> 03:40.910
‎Koyun, this is amazing.

03:40.993 --> 03:42.411
‎They called it "onion hair."

03:42.495 --> 03:44.497
‎-<i>‎Stop that, Hino!</i>
‎-Onions?

03:44.580 --> 03:45.957
<i>‎Amamiya's just over--</i>

03:46.874 --> 03:48.709
<i>‎Oh, man. You see?</i>

03:49.502 --> 03:51.462
<i>‎Miki, what face is that supposed to be?</i>

03:53.297 --> 03:54.840
‎SNAP

03:55.633 --> 03:57.843
‎You look good.

03:57.927 --> 03:59.053
‎What?

04:00.263 --> 04:01.681
‎You all do.

04:07.019 --> 04:09.188
‎SPORTS FESTIVAL
‎MORNING EDITION

04:09.272 --> 04:12.441
‎Go, Yota! Minato!

04:13.109 --> 04:16.696
‎Nope! Too high up! This is legit scary!

04:22.410 --> 04:24.704
<i>‎She looks cute. Like a hamster.</i>

04:24.787 --> 04:26.414
‎So cute!

04:26.914 --> 04:28.541
‎OBSTACLE COURSE

04:28.624 --> 04:30.001
‎SWIFT

04:30.084 --> 04:32.336
‎Koyun, you're so fast!
‎What kind of running is that?

04:32.420 --> 04:33.671
‎GIRL'S TUG-OF-WAR

04:33.754 --> 04:35.047
‎Yeah!

04:35.131 --> 04:37.591
‎Miki! I've never seen you shine
‎more than you do today!

04:37.675 --> 04:39.093
‎ALL-IN RELAY (FIRST YEARS)

04:40.803 --> 04:41.971
‎STEP STEP

04:44.724 --> 04:46.142
‎I am a disgrace...

04:46.225 --> 04:47.518
‎You're fine.

04:47.601 --> 04:49.020
‎CLUB VS CLUB RELAY

04:50.438 --> 04:53.024
‎Minato, what are you doing?
‎That's not like you.

04:54.108 --> 04:55.276
‎Ready for a picture?

05:00.656 --> 05:03.200
‎These outfits are poppin'!

05:03.284 --> 05:04.285
‎Definitely.

05:05.286 --> 05:08.164
<i>‎The pants Miki made for me fit perfectly.</i>

05:08.247 --> 05:10.708
‎Wow! All the seniors look great.

05:10.791 --> 05:11.792
‎Momoka?

05:12.376 --> 05:14.170
‎You look so good in your outfit.

05:14.253 --> 05:15.421
‎You too, Momoka.

05:15.504 --> 05:17.715
‎Don't often see you in an up-do.

05:17.798 --> 05:20.301
‎The third years did it up for me.

05:21.135 --> 05:23.137
‎-Very nice.
‎-<i>‎What's this?</i>

05:23.220 --> 05:24.930
‎-You look nice too.
‎-Thanks.

05:25.014 --> 05:27.683
<i>‎Since when were Miki and Momoka so close?</i>

05:28.267 --> 05:30.478
‎And Tsukiko. You look very cute too.

05:30.561 --> 05:31.687
‎What? What?

05:31.771 --> 05:34.774
‎No, how could I ever compare to you...

05:34.857 --> 05:35.941
‎WARM WARM

05:36.025 --> 05:38.944
‎-You look like a critter. Very cute!
‎-<i>‎What do I do?</i>

05:39.028 --> 05:40.029
‎WHOOSH

05:40.112 --> 05:41.697
‎I forgot something in my locker.

05:41.781 --> 05:42.990
‎Want me to come with?

05:43.074 --> 05:44.116
‎I'm fine.

05:45.618 --> 05:47.787
<i>‎I can't do this. What do I do?</i>

05:48.788 --> 05:51.874
<i>‎What do I do with this disgusting feeling?</i>

05:56.295 --> 05:57.338
‎WHOMP

05:57.421 --> 05:58.422
‎CATCH

05:58.506 --> 05:59.673
‎Koyun?

06:00.925 --> 06:03.094
‎Why do we always
‎seem to bump into each other?

06:03.177 --> 06:05.346
‎I apologize for my lack of due caution.

06:05.429 --> 06:06.806
‎LIFT

06:07.890 --> 06:10.810
‎There you are, Yota. Hayato's over--

06:16.649 --> 06:18.067
‎BANG - WHOA

06:19.860 --> 06:21.695
‎No, it's not--

06:21.779 --> 06:23.030
<i>‎Then what is it?</i>

06:24.824 --> 06:26.200
<i>‎What do I do?</i>

06:27.993 --> 06:29.286
‎I...

06:29.787 --> 06:30.788
‎RUN

06:30.871 --> 06:32.456
‎I'm going back to Miki and the others.

06:33.290 --> 06:34.291
‎PANT PANT

06:34.375 --> 06:36.460
<i>‎What am I doing?</i>

06:38.879 --> 06:40.214
‎Koyun?

06:41.340 --> 06:43.217
‎AFTERNOON
‎CHEER COMPETITION

07:00.609 --> 07:02.987
‎ALL GROUPS SUCCESSFULLY FINISHED

07:03.070 --> 07:06.490
‎TIME FOR PHOTOS
‎(WHILE POINTS ARE TALLIED)

07:08.325 --> 07:09.535
‎FIRST YEARS

07:09.618 --> 07:11.203
‎Thank you so much!

07:11.287 --> 07:12.288
‎He's so good-looking.

07:12.371 --> 07:13.497
‎What a great quality photo.

07:13.581 --> 07:14.582
‎AHAHAHA
‎CHATTER CHATTER

07:14.665 --> 07:16.834
‎I'm gonna print this
‎as a poster for my room.

07:16.917 --> 07:19.211
‎I just gained 100 years of life.

07:19.295 --> 07:21.005
<i>‎To be young again.</i>

07:23.090 --> 07:24.258
<i>‎Shall I get a photo?</i>

07:25.968 --> 07:27.219
<i>‎No, I couldn't.</i>

07:27.303 --> 07:28.596
‎Hello, Amamiya.

07:29.096 --> 07:31.390
‎Can we get a photo together?

07:31.974 --> 07:33.642
‎Yeah, sure.

07:34.226 --> 07:35.478
<i>‎Of course.</i>

07:35.561 --> 07:38.397
<i>‎All you have to do is ask.</i>

07:39.190 --> 07:41.901
<i>‎But I'm too scared to do that right now.</i>

07:43.652 --> 07:45.529
<i>‎I lost everyone.</i>

07:45.613 --> 07:47.781
<i>‎Maybe they've all gone back
‎to the changing rooms?</i>

07:53.996 --> 07:54.997
‎BA-BUMP

07:55.080 --> 07:56.290
‎Koyun!

07:56.373 --> 07:58.042
‎HOP HOP

07:58.125 --> 08:00.044
‎SHE'S CALLING ME...

08:00.127 --> 08:03.255
‎Come get in our photo, Koyun.

08:03.339 --> 08:04.340
‎TROT TROT

08:04.423 --> 08:05.841
<i>‎I hope that's not what she wants.</i>

08:05.925 --> 08:07.384
<i>‎I'd feel like a third wheel.</i>

08:07.468 --> 08:08.552
‎Sorry to trouble you.

08:08.636 --> 08:11.764
‎Could you take our picture for us, please?

08:15.434 --> 08:16.435
‎Sure.

08:17.394 --> 08:18.687
<i>‎Um...</i>

08:19.897 --> 08:22.525
<i>‎What is that face supposed to mean?</i>

08:25.528 --> 08:28.322
‎Thank you. Now, shall we get one together?

08:28.405 --> 08:29.490
‎SWOOSH - CLICK

08:29.573 --> 08:30.574
‎SWOOSH

08:30.658 --> 08:32.535
‎Thank you! And see you!

08:33.035 --> 08:34.828
‎EYES HALF CLOSED &
‎MOUTH HALF OPEN

08:34.912 --> 08:36.205
<i>‎I must look awful in that photo.</i>

08:37.081 --> 08:38.374
‎Let's get a photo over there.

08:38.457 --> 08:39.500
‎Come on. Let's go.

08:42.503 --> 08:43.796
<i>‎-Photos.
‎-Photos.</i>

08:45.089 --> 08:46.674
<i>‎Can we get a picture?</i>

08:46.757 --> 08:48.050
<i>‎I could ask him...</i>

08:49.343 --> 08:51.804
‎-<i>‎This is our only chance.</i>
‎-<i>‎This is our only chance.</i>

08:52.304 --> 08:53.847
‎BA-BUMP
‎OUT OF CHARACTER - IS IT GROSS?

08:53.931 --> 08:55.140
<i>‎I'm searching for reasons not to ask.</i>

08:55.224 --> 08:56.308
‎DON'T EVEN LIKE PHOTOS
‎WILL I GIVE AWAY MY CRUSH?

08:56.392 --> 08:57.393
‎IT'S UNNATURAL - WILL I SCARE HER?

08:57.476 --> 08:58.978
<i>‎All these negative thoughts.</i>

08:59.061 --> 09:00.521
‎Hmm...

09:03.857 --> 09:06.151
‎You two. Stand right there.

09:09.947 --> 09:12.241
‎Okay. We made a memory.

09:12.324 --> 09:14.410
‎Now, Minato. The soccer club's waiting.

09:14.493 --> 09:16.120
‎-Say goodbye.
‎-Hey, wait!

09:16.203 --> 09:19.123
‎Wait a minute! Let me get a better photo.

09:19.206 --> 09:20.499
‎I hate candid shots.

09:20.583 --> 09:21.584
‎What a pain.

09:22.793 --> 09:24.169
‎Got any cool poses?

09:25.588 --> 09:26.672
‎Well...

09:27.965 --> 09:30.134
‎FLUSTER FLUSTER

09:30.718 --> 09:31.719
‎PUNCH

09:31.802 --> 09:33.637
‎-Hey.
‎-Here I go.

09:36.098 --> 09:37.558
‎Minato!

09:38.058 --> 09:40.227
‎Kenta's calling for you.

09:40.311 --> 09:42.021
‎Coming!

09:47.151 --> 09:48.611
‎PLONK

09:52.615 --> 09:56.118
‎Do you think the soccer club
‎is always so casual with its members?

09:56.201 --> 09:57.286
‎Hey, Koyun.

09:57.369 --> 10:00.873
‎Is there something you're hiding from me?

10:04.543 --> 10:06.462
‎SMIRK

10:08.255 --> 10:09.840
‎DISAPPEAR

10:09.923 --> 10:11.175
‎Hey.

10:13.135 --> 10:15.471
‎No. I'm not hiding anything from you.

10:19.516 --> 10:22.936
‎You really can be quite distant, Koyun.

10:23.020 --> 10:25.314
‎-BIRTHDAY? YOU SHOULD'VE TOLD US
‎-WAS I SUPPOSED TO?

10:25.397 --> 10:26.774
‎Like how you kept your birthday from us.

10:26.857 --> 10:30.361
‎-It makes me kind of sad.
‎-<i>‎Soot, soot.</i>

10:30.444 --> 10:31.445
‎LOOK

10:33.238 --> 10:37.576
‎It's not that I'm hiding it, it's just...

10:39.203 --> 10:41.497
‎I only just noticed it myself recently.

10:41.580 --> 10:42.790
‎Okay.

10:42.873 --> 10:45.542
‎I thought it could be
‎just me imagining things.

10:46.043 --> 10:48.629
‎I don't know it for certain yet.

10:48.712 --> 10:49.713
‎Okay.

10:49.797 --> 10:55.844
‎So I didn't think it was worth
‎mentioning to others yet.

10:57.262 --> 11:01.975
‎If it's something churning around inside
‎that you can't seem to set straight,

11:02.559 --> 11:06.063
‎maybe letting it out
‎might help you feel better?

11:07.314 --> 11:10.609
‎You definitely helped me feel better.

11:15.197 --> 11:16.240
‎Yota.

11:17.699 --> 11:18.784
‎CREEP CREEP

11:18.867 --> 11:19.868
‎OPEN - RATTLE

11:19.952 --> 11:20.953
‎COME HERE

11:21.703 --> 11:23.622
‎CREEP CREEP

11:23.705 --> 11:26.125
‎LOOK LOOK

11:30.671 --> 11:33.215
‎So, I...

11:43.892 --> 11:45.436
‎I see.

11:45.978 --> 11:49.398
‎Koyun. You have the worst taste.

11:50.190 --> 11:53.652
<i>‎He says that, but he looks happy enough.</i>

11:55.195 --> 11:56.488
<i>‎I get it now.</i>

11:57.656 --> 11:59.283
<i>‎We both feel the same way.</i>

12:02.286 --> 12:03.662
‎If I'm being really truly honest...

12:05.164 --> 12:09.585
‎At first, I felt awkward around him.
‎You could say I was almost scared of him.

12:10.419 --> 12:12.337
‎That's how it started.

12:12.838 --> 12:15.090
‎But why?

12:15.841 --> 12:17.801
‎How did I not notice
‎my feelings had changed?

12:18.594 --> 12:24.016
‎I mean, I can't explain why,
‎or what even this is, but...

12:26.226 --> 12:27.811
‎That's just how it is.

12:35.277 --> 12:37.571
‎Shall I work on getting you two alone?

12:37.654 --> 12:39.031
‎Do not do that!

12:39.656 --> 12:42.951
‎SHE DOES IT

12:43.535 --> 12:44.828
‎I'm so sorry.

12:44.912 --> 12:46.038
‎HAHA

12:46.997 --> 12:52.294
‎I... I don't want to take things
‎any further than friends.

12:52.377 --> 12:53.504
‎MATSURI - ONDO NO MASTER

12:53.587 --> 12:55.672
<i>‎I'm just happy for us to hang out together</i>

12:55.756 --> 12:58.258
<i>‎and to get along as friends.</i>

12:58.342 --> 13:00.802
<i>‎I feel like that's all I need.</i>

13:01.553 --> 13:04.139
‎Where we are right now
‎feels the most comfortable.

13:05.682 --> 13:06.975
‎I don't want to ruin that.

13:09.978 --> 13:11.730
‎You're just like me.

13:12.940 --> 13:16.860
‎Is my heart gonna be
‎covered in soot soon too?

13:17.361 --> 13:18.487
‎Welcome to the club.

13:18.570 --> 13:20.113
‎I don't want this.

13:21.782 --> 13:24.535
<i>‎All points have been tallied.</i>

13:24.618 --> 13:28.789
<i>‎Please come to the school courtyard
‎for the closing ceremony.</i>

13:28.872 --> 13:31.166
‎But this is Minato we're talking about.

13:31.667 --> 13:33.502
‎This is gonna be tough.

13:33.585 --> 13:36.338
‎Yeah, I can imagine.

13:38.674 --> 13:39.675
‎FOUND YOU!

13:39.758 --> 13:41.677
‎Koyun! Yota! There you are.

13:45.055 --> 13:47.391
‎Perfect! We found you just in time.

13:47.474 --> 13:49.476
‎We still don't have a photo
‎with all four of us.

13:50.185 --> 13:51.228
<i>‎What do I do?</i>

13:51.311 --> 13:54.982
<i>‎Now I'm overly self-conscious because
‎we were literally just talking about it.</i>

13:56.858 --> 13:59.486
<i>‎Were Yota and Koyun alone just now?</i>

14:00.237 --> 14:02.990
<i>‎They were together all this time?</i>

14:03.073 --> 14:04.700
‎LOOK

14:05.325 --> 14:06.326
‎BUMP

14:06.410 --> 14:07.411
<i>‎Don't you look at me.</i>

14:07.494 --> 14:08.495
‎BONK

14:08.579 --> 14:09.746
<i>‎Same goes for you.</i>

14:11.790 --> 14:12.791
‎HEH

14:14.376 --> 14:15.377
‎AGAPE

14:15.460 --> 14:18.297
<i>‎Where we are right now
‎feels the most comfortable.</i>

14:22.301 --> 14:23.719
<i>‎I don't want to ruin that.</i>

14:24.928 --> 14:26.179
<i>‎I want to keep it...</i>

14:28.390 --> 14:29.641
‎Ready?

14:30.142 --> 14:31.143
‎PUSH

14:31.226 --> 14:32.644
‎Get closer.

14:32.728 --> 14:33.729
‎CLICK

14:33.812 --> 14:38.525
<i>‎I really hope things can stay
‎as peaceful as they are right now.</i>

14:40.027 --> 14:43.071
‎GRADE 2 CLASS 2

14:43.155 --> 14:44.364
‎AFTER HOMEROOM

14:44.448 --> 14:47.826
‎This year's sports festival
‎was so much more fun than last year's.

14:47.910 --> 14:49.328
‎I feel the same.

14:49.411 --> 14:50.412
‎CHATTER CHATTER

14:50.495 --> 14:54.625
‎I was nervous about cheering,
‎but once I got into it, I had fun.

14:54.708 --> 14:55.709
‎Agreed.

14:55.792 --> 14:58.378
‎LAST YEAR'S SPORTS FESTIVAL
‎CLASS WITH ZERO SOLIDARITY

14:58.462 --> 15:01.965
‎I guess these things
‎depend on who you do it with.

15:02.049 --> 15:04.843
‎I was just thinking that,
‎but you didn't have to say it out loud.

15:04.927 --> 15:07.220
‎By the way, where's Miki?

15:07.304 --> 15:08.722
‎GRADE 2 CLASS 2
‎ON THE PE COMMITTEE

15:08.805 --> 15:10.349
‎She's on clean-up duty.

15:10.432 --> 15:11.433
‎HEH HEH

15:11.516 --> 15:12.851
<i>‎Good luck, Yota.</i>

15:12.935 --> 15:15.854
‎All right! Let's go do karaoke!

15:15.938 --> 15:17.356
‎HERE FOR SOME REASON

15:17.439 --> 15:20.233
‎-I'm starving.
‎-I'm gonna order a mountain of fries.

15:20.317 --> 15:21.568
‎-Yeah!
‎-Yay!

15:21.652 --> 15:22.819
‎Shall we wait for Yota?

15:22.903 --> 15:25.030
‎-I'll shoot him a message.
‎-Okay.

15:25.113 --> 15:27.115
‎The guys seem in good spirits.

15:27.199 --> 15:28.700
‎They sure do.

15:39.211 --> 15:40.212
‎PLONK

15:40.295 --> 15:42.464
‎-Can I help you?
‎-You looked at me.

15:43.298 --> 15:44.925
‎Are you guys waiting for Miki?

15:45.008 --> 15:47.386
‎No. We were just about to head home.

15:47.970 --> 15:50.263
‎She told us to go on without her.

15:50.347 --> 15:51.390
‎I see.

15:52.265 --> 15:55.102
‎Well then, Amamiya. I'll see you later.

15:55.769 --> 15:57.145
‎Let's go, Tsukiko.

15:58.438 --> 16:00.899
<i>‎Really, Koyuki? Just like that?</i>

16:01.483 --> 16:04.361
<i>‎Amamiya probably wanted to talk to you.</i>

16:04.444 --> 16:07.197
<i>‎Then again, I'm not going to stop you.</i>

16:10.742 --> 16:13.787
‎I'll send you the photo
‎we took today later, okay?

16:14.371 --> 16:16.373
‎SHE'S GOING TO GET IN TOUCH LATER

16:16.873 --> 16:18.792
<i>‎Lucky you, Amamiya!</i>

16:18.875 --> 16:20.669
‎Hey, wait!

16:20.752 --> 16:22.921
‎The wrap party on Saturday.

16:23.005 --> 16:24.923
‎Are you coming?

16:26.842 --> 16:28.176
‎What party?

16:28.260 --> 16:30.303
‎The wrap party for the cheer squad.

16:30.387 --> 16:31.680
‎We're going out for yakiniku.

16:31.763 --> 16:33.181
‎-Since when?
‎-Since when?

16:33.765 --> 16:37.936
‎We literally just got a text message
‎requesting attendance for the blue group.

16:38.729 --> 16:40.147
‎Hey, you're right.

16:40.647 --> 16:42.733
‎I turned off notifications,
‎so I didn't hear it.

16:42.816 --> 16:43.817
‎Same.

16:43.900 --> 16:46.403
‎Why would you turn off notifications?

16:46.486 --> 16:48.071
‎-Too many people.
‎-Too many people.

16:48.155 --> 16:50.157
‎BLUE GROUP - ENDLESS RESPONSE
‎GOT IT - OK - ALL RIGHT - YES

16:50.240 --> 16:51.241
‎HANG

16:51.324 --> 16:54.286
‎Hey, Amamiya. What are you up to now?

16:54.369 --> 16:57.956
‎And here you are again.
‎In my class. As usual.

16:58.040 --> 16:59.875
‎Hey, what's going on?

16:59.958 --> 17:01.043
‎The wrap party.

17:02.169 --> 17:03.170
‎You coming?

17:03.253 --> 17:04.463
‎Well...

17:04.963 --> 17:07.924
‎I dunno, I have work on Saturday, so...

17:08.008 --> 17:09.426
‎What time?

17:09.509 --> 17:11.928
‎From 11:00 till 3:00.

17:12.012 --> 17:15.932
‎We're meeting at 6:00.
‎That's plenty of time.

17:16.016 --> 17:18.101
‎You're not coming, Hikawa?

17:18.185 --> 17:21.480
‎Why not? We all need to be there.

17:21.563 --> 17:23.190
‎You're one to talk.

17:23.273 --> 17:25.484
‎Come on! Let's go.

17:25.567 --> 17:27.360
‎Shimojima's not coming either?
‎Now I'm sad.

17:27.444 --> 17:28.445
‎UM...

17:28.528 --> 17:30.989
‎We're all the ones from Class 2, right?

17:31.073 --> 17:32.365
‎LOOKY LOOKY

17:32.449 --> 17:33.450
‎NOD

17:34.451 --> 17:35.952
‎Okay. We'll come.

17:37.788 --> 17:38.997
‎-See you.
‎-See you.

17:39.081 --> 17:40.290
‎See you tomorrow.

17:40.874 --> 17:43.126
‎They just had a whole
‎conversation without words.

17:43.210 --> 17:44.211
‎SATURDAY

17:44.294 --> 17:47.172
‎Girls scare me like that, man.

17:47.255 --> 17:48.715
‎My heart's pounding.

17:49.299 --> 17:51.093
‎We agreed to go!

17:51.176 --> 17:52.302
‎We did.

17:52.385 --> 17:57.015
‎I can already see myself hiding
‎in a corner struggling to keep up.

17:57.099 --> 17:58.350
‎What do I do?

17:58.433 --> 18:00.185
‎Let me sit with you.

18:00.811 --> 18:02.479
‎SUPPLIES
‎SCAVENGER HUNT

18:02.562 --> 18:06.066
‎Man, the sports festival
‎was over in a flash.

18:06.149 --> 18:07.150
‎It sure was.

18:07.234 --> 18:10.779
‎I'm already sad thinking we won't
‎get to practice cheering anymore.

18:10.862 --> 18:13.740
‎-But I'm excited for the wrap party.
‎-Me too.

18:13.824 --> 18:14.908
‎SUPPLIES ROOM

18:16.618 --> 18:20.163
‎Sure, there's the wrap party, but we four
‎have gotta hang out again soon.

18:20.247 --> 18:21.790
‎Where shall we go next?

18:21.873 --> 18:23.416
‎Maybe back to Uppi for round two?

18:24.209 --> 18:27.337
‎They might have different events on
‎for different seasons in the year.

18:27.420 --> 18:28.421
‎UPPI

18:28.505 --> 18:30.423
‎We could see Uppi in all four seasons.

18:30.507 --> 18:32.801
‎I'd like to see that. That's a great idea.

18:33.760 --> 18:35.679
‎But just putting it out there,

18:35.762 --> 18:39.057
‎I haven't forgotten about our promise
‎to hang out just the two of us.

18:39.141 --> 18:41.017
‎You'd better not forget either.

18:43.353 --> 18:44.604
‎I would never--

18:44.688 --> 18:46.064
‎Let's do it all!

18:47.524 --> 18:48.733
‎Miki!

19:02.539 --> 19:03.790
‎Ouch...

19:04.291 --> 19:06.209
‎Yota, are you all right?

19:07.419 --> 19:10.881
‎Sorry! No, I mean-- Something fell.

19:10.964 --> 19:12.465
‎I get it.

19:12.549 --> 19:14.092
‎Thank you, Yota.

19:15.177 --> 19:17.846
‎You bumped your forehead. Are you okay?

19:19.681 --> 19:21.558
‎I'm fine.

19:25.103 --> 19:26.813
‎Hold up.

19:26.897 --> 19:29.441
‎You're acting like a little boy
‎embarrassed by girls.

19:29.524 --> 19:32.485
‎Cut that out, bro. It's just me.

19:33.486 --> 19:36.698
‎It's not about being boys and girls...

19:39.075 --> 19:42.245
‎To me... You're just Miki.

19:47.209 --> 19:48.335
<i>‎What does that mean?</i>

19:48.835 --> 19:52.756
‎Of course I'm me! I'm not "not" me.

20:11.650 --> 20:14.152
‎I'm glad it was only light things inside.

20:15.195 --> 20:17.822
‎Right. Are you okay from the fall?

20:17.906 --> 20:19.074
‎Your head good? Your back?

20:19.157 --> 20:20.909
‎I'm completely fine.

20:20.992 --> 20:23.787
<i>‎What happened just now?</i>

20:24.371 --> 20:25.413
<i>‎It's like...</i>

20:30.460 --> 20:31.670
‎Come here.

20:36.174 --> 20:38.551
<i>‎No, wait...</i>

20:39.052 --> 20:40.679
<i>‎No way, no way...</i>

20:43.098 --> 20:45.392
<i>‎But... Me?</i>

20:45.892 --> 20:48.103
<i>‎He can't possibly see me that way, right?</i>

20:57.654 --> 20:59.072
‎SWOOSH

20:59.155 --> 21:00.824
‎Well then...

21:00.907 --> 21:02.617
‎There. All done!

21:03.159 --> 21:05.578
‎Leaving! Locking the doors!

21:05.662 --> 21:07.664
‎I'll handle the keys!

21:07.747 --> 21:09.749
‎Buh-bye. See you!

21:09.833 --> 21:10.834
‎So quick.

21:12.210 --> 21:13.378
‎Miki...

21:17.757 --> 21:22.512
<i>‎If Yota really feels that way...</i>

21:23.346 --> 21:25.598
<i>‎how long has he felt it?</i>

21:35.400 --> 21:37.068
‎CLICK CLICK
‎WHOOSH WHOOSH

21:37.152 --> 21:39.195
<i>‎I thought we were just friends?</i>

21:41.281 --> 21:42.949
<i>‎What do I do?</i>

21:43.033 --> 21:45.327
<i>‎Has our friendship been so one-sided</i>

21:45.410 --> 21:48.121
<i>‎all this time?</i>

21:48.204 --> 21:51.333
<i>‎If it's all been a sham...</i>

21:52.667 --> 21:53.668
‎I love you.

21:55.503 --> 21:56.796
‎Yeah.

21:56.880 --> 21:58.173
‎I love you too.

22:00.300 --> 22:01.718
<i>‎What do I do?</i>

22:03.303 --> 22:05.221
<i>‎All of our memories so far...</i>

22:05.930 --> 22:07.265
<i>‎Everything he's said to me...</i>

22:09.517 --> 22:11.436
<i>‎How nice he is to me...</i>

22:11.519 --> 22:13.897
<i>‎This changes everything.</i>

23:50.285 --> 23:55.290
‎Subtitle translation by: Rychelle Brittain
